      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the older man with short white hair, a lean muscular physique, and dark grey swim trunks, appearing in <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is the younger man with short dark wavy hair, a tanned athletic build, and bright red swim trunks with yellow side stripes, appearing in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> is the tropical beach environment at sunset, featuring a wide sandy shore, calm ocean waves, and silhouetted palm trees against an orange and purple sky, as shown in <Picture 3>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video depicts <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> walking together on <Subject 3>. They stop for a romantic moment where <Subject 1> speaks in Dutch, after which <Subject 2> pulls him into a kiss.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the white hair, facial structure, and muscular build are retained from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the dark wavy hair, tanned skin, and athletic physique are retained from <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the sunset color palette, sandy terrain, and palm tree silhouettes are preserved from <Picture 3>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video has a romantic cinematic style with warm golden-hour lighting.\n[Shot 1] A medium tracking shot follows <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> walking side-by-side along the wet sand of <Subject 3>, their bare feet leaving shallow imprints. The low sun casts long shadows across the beach. They stop near the water's edge and face one another. <Subject 1> (S1) looks into the younger man's eyes with a gentle expression and says, <d>[Dutch] Ik hou van je.</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:06.500, the camera pushes in to a close-up as <Subject 2> reaches out and firmly grasps <Subject 1>'s face with both hands. He tilts the older man's head slightly upward and kisses him on the mouth. The sunset glow reflects off the rippling water behind them.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft rhythmic waves of the ocean lapping against the sand and the sound of their bare feet walking on wet ground.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA gentle, romantic instrumental score featuring a solo piano with warm string swells, maintaining a slow tempo that resolves softly as the kiss begins."
